Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:03.83,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Dez pras seis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.57,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Estou de rastos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:07.15,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou preparar o jantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.15,0:00:08.19,Vlog,,0,0,0,,A partir das seis da tarde
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:09.07,Vlog,,0,0,0,,isso é loucura, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:11.36,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Como hoje a Clara tem treino
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.27,Vlog,,0,0,0,,na ginástica e chega um bocadinho tarde,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.07,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou ser honesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:15.04,Vlog,,0,0,0,,eu ia fazer jantar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.43,Vlog,,0,0,0,,mas já não vou, porque, não dá.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.59,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou fazer uns ovos e vou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:18.47,Vlog,,0,0,0,,servir a sopa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:20.00,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Eu descobri a melhor sopa de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.03,Vlog,,0,0,0,,sempre no Continente,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.16,Vlog,,0,0,0,,a receita do chef,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:23.20,Vlog,,0,0,0,,sopa de abóbora,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.13,Vlog,,0,0,0,,camarão e coentros, é maravilhosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:25.80,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Amamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:26.93,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá tomar banhoca,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:31.90,Vlog,,0,0,0,,É sopa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:32.62,Vlog,,0,0,0,,não é doce,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:34.47,Vlog,,0,0,0,,não pode ser sempre doce, filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:41.34,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Posso ficar com mais sopa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:41.92,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Podes, podes.
